{"id": "t099-005", "text": "Noor's housewarming has been called off because the move fell through at the last minute. She sounded gutted about the flat.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move fell through", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t099-006", "text": "Henrik only drinks alcohol-free beer these days, and he's particular about it. Apparently Lucky Saint is the only one he rates.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Henrik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks alcohol-free beer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "these days"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Lucky Saint", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t099-007", "text": "Spoke to Gabriel after his appointment on Tuesday. The scan came back clear, he's relieved. His wife Saskia is still a bit shaken though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gabriel", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit shaken", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t099-011", "text": "Ivan's mum had a hip replacement last week. He's driving up every weekend to help and seems exhausted. I should send him a message on Friday to check how she's doing. He also mentioned she can only eat soft food for now and is sick of soup, so maybe a care box with those little custard pots she likes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every weekend"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sick of soup", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "little custard pots", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t099-016", "text": "Yasmin's brother Nasser is in hospital with appendicitis. Surgery went fine on Sunday, but he'll be in until at least Thursday. She's worried about him missing his exams, which start on 1st of December, and their parents are abroad so she's doing all the hospital visits on her own. I should offer to drive her in one evening this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appendicitis", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Surgery", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until at least Thursday"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exams", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "1st of December", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "offer to drive her in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "one evening this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t099-018", "text": "Zofia's dog Pierogi had an operation on his paw yesterday. She was in bits on the phone. Remind me to ask Zofia how he's recovering on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Pierogi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Zofia how he's recovering", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t099-020", "text": "Matilda is pregnant again! Due in May 2027. She's off caffeine and finding it miserable.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Due", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "off caffeine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "miserable", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t099-021", "text": "Aneesh had his cataract surgery on 12 October and is already back to reading. Very chuffed about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 October", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "reading", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "chuffed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t099-026", "text": "Niamh's thirtieth on 27 November at hers. Dress code is 'sparkly'. She hinted that she'd love a decent cocktail shaker.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "thirtieth", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "27 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a decent cocktail shaker", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t099-027", "text": "Mrs Johnson next door is having her other knee done in the new year. She asked if I could feed the cat for a few days while she's in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Johnson", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her other knee done", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days while she's in"}]}
{"id": "t099-034", "text": "Chiara asked whether we'd come to her engagement dinner. It's on 6th of February 2027 at her parents' place in Bristol. Her mum is doing a huge Italian spread, and Chiara says there will be vegan options for her, thank goodness.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "engagement dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6th of February 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t099-036", "text": "Noor rang about the hospital. Her grandad's had a fall and they're keeping him in for observation. She sounded tired. She's been there every evening since Friday and her mum is struggling to cope. I said I'd come by on Wednesday with food. Should also message her sister Eva to see if she needs a break covering visits.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in for observation", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tired", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening since Friday"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling to cope", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her sister Eva", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}]}
{"id": "t099-041", "text": "Aneesh mentioned he's trying keto, so no bread basket at Friday's dinner. He's lost a stone already.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aneesh", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying keto", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lost a stone", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t099-045", "text": "Don't forget to order the cake for Mum's 70th on 3rd of January 2027. She only likes lemon drizzle, nothing with cream.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "order the cake for Mum's 70th", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "only likes lemon drizzle", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nothing with cream", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t099-046", "text": "Nikolai's dad came through the bypass fine. Long recovery ahead, and the family are taking turns at the hospital. Nikolai sounded wiped out but relieved. His dad is home from the 28th if all goes well, and his mum is already panicking about the diet changes the cardiologist gave them. Low salt, no fried food, much less red meat. Remind me to send Nikolai that heart-healthy recipe book.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bypass", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wiped out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the 28th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking about the diet changes", "owner": "r4", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r5", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cardiologist", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "Low salt, no fried food, much less red meat", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Nikolai that heart-healthy recipe book", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t099-050", "text": "Saskia mentioned Gabriel's follow-up appointment is on 2/12. She's worried it'll be bad news again. Remind me to text her the day after to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Saskia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gabriel", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "follow-up appointment", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2/12", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t099-052", "text": "Housewarming at Bruno and Nora's new place on 15 November. They've moved into a two-bed near the park. Bruno asked everyone to bring a dish because he's doing the drinks. I'm doing my dal since Nora is vegetarian. Their cat Biscuit is apparently hiding under the bed until the boxes go. Nora said her parents are coming down from Glasgow for it too, first time they've seen the place.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "15 November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "two-bed near the park", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the boxes go"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nora", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t099-056", "text": "Alfie is hosting a tasting menu night for friends on 7 December to practise for the course. He asked for allergies in advance. I'm fine, but Jess and Lin will need sorting: no mushrooms for Jess, and no dairy for Lin. Finn says Alfie has been testing dishes every night for a fortnight and the kitchen looks like a bomb site. I need to tell Alfie about both by the end of the week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tasting menu night", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7 December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in advance", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "no mushrooms", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "no dairy", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night for a fortnight"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "tell Alfie about both", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t099-060", "text": "Mental note: the Osei barbecue is on 31 May 2027, assuming Ayesha's back from her trip by then. Her husband Nasser said they'll do halal everything and plenty of grilled veg. Ayesha's trip is a month in Pakistan for her cousin's wedding, flying out 20 April 2027. Must remember to ask her for some proper mangoes if she's bringing any back.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Osei barbecue", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "31 May 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by then", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "halal", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "20 April 2027", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her for some proper mangoes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
